# Puzzle Mount — Project Context

3D puzzle-adventure (Unity 6, URP, New Input System). Player: **Tim Jones**. Companion camera: **Leya** (Inspection Mode via Tab).

## Active code only
- Game logic: `Assets/Scripts/`
- Main scenes: `Assets/Scenes/00.unity`, `SampleScene.unity`
- **Ignore** `Assets/Legacy/` (deprecated `.txt` archives) and asset-pack demo scenes (`ISOMETRIC 3D RUINS/`, `DevTex/`, `Blink/`)

## Key systems
| System | Entry points |
|--------|-------------|
| Movement | `CharacterMovement`, `CameraFollow` |
| Inspection cam | `LeyasCamera`, toggled from `CameraFollow` |
| Cube interaction | `TimCubeController`, `RunodeMovement` |
| Power flow | `PowerManager` → `PowerSource` BFS → `RunodeFace` → `PowerDisplayManager` |
| Puzzle outputs | `PowerReceiver`, `LeverReceiver`, `ForgottenGate`, `PowerSocket` |

## Rules for the agent
- Read `AGENTS.md` for full architecture before large changes
- Minimal diffs; no unrelated refactors
- "Runode" is intentional spelling — do not rename to "Rune"
- Managers are **manually placed in scenes** — don't auto-spawn them
- User verifies in Unity Play mode; ask for Console errors if compile fails
